WEBVTT

c1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.800
<v MIRA>Did you hear that?

c2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.500
<v JONAS>Only the wind.
It always sounds like footsteps up here.

c3
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.000
(A door creaks somewhere below.)

c4
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.500
<v MIRA>Wind doesn't knock twice &amp; wait.

c5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
<v ОЛЬГА>Тише. Я слышу шаги на лестнице.

c6
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.000
<v JONAS>Pressure is &lt;dropping&gt; fast, see the gauge?
We should go.

c7
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:23.500
<v MIRA>Not before we know who else is in this lighthouse tonight.

c8
01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:02.400
<v ОЛЬГА>Stay.
Listen.
Then run.
